<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0679_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kay &amp; Tia</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You had fun scrappin’ us, right?\rSwap numbers, so if we wanna scrap\nagain we can just call?\fWe share a phone. Don’t ask which one\fyou talkin’ to. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, now you got our number and we\ngot yours. We’ll fight over who calls.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? But... Oh well.\nTia’s mad. I’m Kay. Or I’m Tia.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You decide you wanna swap\nnumbers after all? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, here you go!\nIt’s a Oval Stone.\fTia found it. Or Kay did. One of us.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nWait, ain’t you right nearby?\rYou just REALLY like talkin’ on the\nphone? Weird hobby. We love it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} WAY stronger now!\rWe scrapped a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} and it was\nover before we knew it!\rOh yeah, by the way, this Tia.\fProb’ly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Our {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} WAY stronger now!\rWe scrapped a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} and it was\nover before we knew it!\rOh yeah, by the way, this Kay.\fWe think.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Earlier we saw a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} on\nRoute 15. Didn’t we, Tia?\rYeah, then outta nowhere a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\npopped out. Didn’t it, Kay?\rYeah, and we was so shook we just\nran. Didn’t we, Tia?\rI keep thinkin’ about it, Kay, and\nI think since we got homies,\fwe shoulda just scrapped, right?\rIs it hard to tell who’s who when\nyou on the phone with both of us?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We shoulda another scrap, just\nthe three of us.\rWe on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so c’mon over!\nWe’ll be the ones that look the same.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Didn’t we make plans to scrap again?\rWe waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0},\nso don’t forget, OK? Both of us.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Since we on the phone, how ’bout a\nquiz?\r...\rWho talkin’ right now? Kay or Tia?\r... ...\f...\f...\fThe correct answer is...\rEleanor from the Homie Fan Club, who\nstandin’ next to the twins!\fWe let her use the phone sometimes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, Tia found a Oval Stone.\rIt’s yours if you find us on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Got it? Kay says hi.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0679_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nWe’ll give you a Oval Stone...\fKay is holdin’ it. Or Tia.</language>
	</row>
</body>
